==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Cooldown Equality}}

==Battleground==
*5 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 8.67 seconds<sup>260f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*3 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sir Metal Seal]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
**1 [[Tackey]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Felix the Cat Duke Cat (Special Cat)|Felix the Cat]] and [[Hundred-Million-Dollar Cat|Hundred Million Dollar Cat]] will save you here. These two units destroy the Metal Doges and turn them into sources of cash rather than sources of suffering. Just use [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell Cat]] or some tanker to protect Felix since he might die otherwise. Other good options are [[Soba Cat]] and [[Hoop Cat (Rare Cat)|Hoopmaster Cat]]. Any rushers/damagers to kill the [[Dark Otter|Dark Otters]] will suffice, but [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Yukimura]] is the best choice.

